# 9. 3-Day Preparation Schedule

## Day 1 — Advanced Excel & MIS Core

### Watch — 1 Hour 20 Minutes

- [ ] Excel Formulas & Functions — **35 mins**
- [ ] MIS Executive Course — **45 mins**

### Practice — 2.5 Hours

Practice these Excel functions:

- [ ] `IF`
- [ ] Nested `IF`
- [ ] `XLOOKUP`
- [ ] `INDEX-MATCH`
- [ ] `SUMIFS`
- [ ] `COUNTIFS`
- [ ] `TEXTJOIN`

Also practice:

- [ ] Pivot Tables
- [ ] Calculated Fields
- [ ] Conditional Formatting
- [ ] Data Cleaning
- [ ] Sorting & Filtering
- [ ] MIS Report Creation

---

# Day 2 — WFM & NICE IEX

## Watch — 1 Hour 10 Minutes

- [ ] Basics on WFM — **18 mins**
- [ ] Shrinkage & SLA — **14 mins**
- [ ] NICE WFM — **6 mins**
- [ ] MIS/WFM Interview Q&A — **22 mins**

